{
  "info": {
    "name": "ShopNest E-commerce API",
    "description": "Learning API for the React e-commerce project.\n\n1. Import this collection **and** the environment file.\n2. Select the **ShopNest Local** environment (top right).\n3. Run **Auth → Login (demo user)** first — the token is saved automatically into `{{token}}`.\n4. Age Groups → *Get age groups* saves `{{ageGroupId}}`; Products → *Get products* saves the first product id into `{{productId}}` for the detail requests.\n\nSwagger docs: http://localhost:5000/api/docs",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "General",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"success is true\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().success).to.be.true);"
